  "prefLabel": "Csp 102.03 Membership",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 102.03 Membership. The commission shall consist of members who shall be appointed from time to time, and who shall serve, in accordance with RSA 195-H:2, I(a). The commission shall maintain a list of current members of the commission at the treasurer’s office.\n\nSource. #7082, eff 8-26-99; ss by #9583, eff 11-2-09",
